---
import Container from '@/components/Container.astro';
---

<section class="py-16 md:py-24 relative overflow-hidden md:pb-8" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:1">
  <Container>
    <!-- Header Section -->
    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8 mb-12 relative z-10 w-full" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:2">
      <div class="max-w-2xl" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:3">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#E9F3E4] text-[#4B9511] font-bold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm mb-4" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:4">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>
          WICHTIG FÜR VERMIETER
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-secondary mb-4 leading-tight" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:5">Diese Rauchmelderkosten können Vermieter<span class="relative inline-block" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:not-underline">
            <span class="relative z-10" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:not-text">weitergeben</span>
            <svg class="absolute -bottom-1 left-0 w-full h-[8px] z-0 text-[#4B9511]" preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="0 0 100 10" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M0 8C30 2 70 2 100 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </span> !</h2>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-muted-foreground" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:6">
          Bestimmte Kosten können Vermieter unter<br/>gesetzlichen Voraussetzungen weitergeben.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="w-full max-w-md lg:absolute lg:right-0 lg:top-[-40px] lg:w-[450px]" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:7">
        <img src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/2be62e80/images/Service-Kosten-spaaren-Bild-1024.webp" alt="Sparen für Vermieter" class="w-full h-auto object-contain md:w-[457px]" loading="lazy" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:dajjbl" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Columns -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-8 relative z-10 w-full" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:8">
      
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-border shadow-lg flex flex-col" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:9">
        <div class="p-6 border-b border-border" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:10">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:11">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#4B9511] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold shrink-0" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:asaf01">1</div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#4B9511] leading-tight" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:z6dmm8">Ersteinbau:<br/>Mieterhöhung möglich</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-center mb-6 h-40" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:asaf00">
            <img src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/2be62e80/images/Mieterhohung-nach-Installation-Bild-Haus-320.webp" alt="8% Mieterhöhung" class="h-full w-auto object-contain" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:dajjbk" />
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-4 mb-6" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:12">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:jqzsxn">
              <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#4B9511] text-white flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:asaezz"><svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div>
              <span class="text-sm font-medium text-foreground" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:g2brah">Der erstmalige Einbau gilt regelmäßig als Modernisierung.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:jqzsxm">
              <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#4B9511] text-white flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:ouu4uv"><svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div>
              <span class="text-sm font-medium text-foreground" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:g2brai">Nach § 559 BGB kann die jährliche Nettokaltmiete um 8 % der anrechenbaren, auf die Wohnung entfallenden Kosten erhöht werden.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-[#F4F9F1] rounded-b-2xl flex-grow" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:13">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:ouu4uw">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#4B9511] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15"></path></svg>
            <span class="text-sm text-foreground" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:g2braj">Ein gleichwertiger Austausch vorhandener Melder zählt grundsätzlich nicht als Modernisierung.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-border shadow-lg flex flex-col" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:14">
        <div class="p-6 border-b border-border" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:15">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:16">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-secondary text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold shrink-0" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:ouu4ux">2</div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-secondary leading-tight" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:z6dmm7">Wartung:<br/>über Nebenkosten möglich</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-center mb-6 h-40" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:ouu4uy">
            <img src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/2be62e80/images/Nebenkosten-Abrechnung-1024.webp" alt="Wartung Prüfung" class="h-full w-auto object-contain" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:dajjbj" />
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-4 mb-6" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:17">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:jqzsxl">
              <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-secondary text-white flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:ouu4uz"><svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div>
              <span class="text-sm font-medium text-foreground" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:g2brb5">Wiederkehrende Prüf- und Wartungskosten gelten grundsätzlich als sonstige Betriebskosten. Sie können abgerechnet werden, wenn der Mietvertrag die Umlage wirksam vorsieht.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-[#F0F7FA] rounded-b-2xl flex-grow" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:18">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:ouu4v0">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-secondary shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"></path></svg>
            <span class="text-sm text-secondary font-medium" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:g2brb6">Voraussetzung:<br/>wirksame Umlage im Mietvertrag.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-border shadow-lg flex flex-col" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:19">
        <div class="p-6 border-b border-border" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:20">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:21">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#B22222] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold shrink-0" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:ouu4v1">3</div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#B22222] leading-tight" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:z6dmm6">Achtung bei<br/>Gerätemiete</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-center mb-6 h-40" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:ouu4v2">
            <img src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/2be62e80/images/Nebenkosten-Warnmelder-Mietvertrag-Bild-320.webp" alt="Mietvertrag Achtung" class="h-full w-auto object-contain" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:dajjbi" />
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-4 mb-6" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:22">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:jqzsxk">
              <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#B22222] text-white flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:ouu4v3"><span class="font-bold text-xs" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:g2brb7">!</span></div>
              <span class="text-sm font-medium text-foreground" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:g2brb8">Reine Mietkosten für Rauchwarnmelder dürfen laut Bundesgerichtshof nicht als Betriebskosten auf Mieter umgelegt werden.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-[#FDF2F2] rounded-b-2xl flex-grow flex items-center" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:23">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 w-full" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:ouu4v4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#B22222] shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 6l3 1m0 0l-3 9a5.002 5.002 0 006.001 0M6 7l3 9M6 7l6-2m6 2l3-1m-3 1l-3 9a5.002 5.002 0 006.001 0M18 7l3 9m-3-9l-6-2m0-2v2m0 16V5m0 16H9m3 0h3"></path></svg>
            <span class="text-sm text-[#B22222] font-bold" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:g2brb9">BGH: VIII ZR 379/20</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- 4 Features Row -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-6 relative z-10" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:24">
      <div class="bg-white border border-border rounded-xl p-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 shadow-sm" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:25">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#4B9511]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
        <span class="text-sm font-bold text-secondary" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:g2brba">Klare Kosten</span>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white border border-border rounded-xl p-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 shadow-sm" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:26">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-secondary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 013.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010 4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-4.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138-3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010-4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 013.138-3.138z"></path></svg>
        <span class="text-sm font-bold text-secondary" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:g2brbb">Getrennte Positionen</span>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white border border-border rounded-xl p-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 shadow-sm" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:27">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#4B9511]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path></svg>
        <span class="text-sm font-bold text-secondary" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:g2brbc">Digitale Nachweise</span>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white border border-border rounded-xl p-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 shadow-sm" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:28">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-secondary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4.354a4 4 0 110 5.292M15 21H3v-1a6 6 0 0112 0v1zm0 0h6v-1a6 6 0 00-9-5.197M13 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"></path></svg>
        <span class="text-sm font-bold text-secondary" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:g2brbd">Grundlage für Vermieter</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Info Notice -->
    <div class="bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-border rounded-xl p-4 flex items-start gap-4 relative z-10 w-full" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:29">
      <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-secondary text-white flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:30">
        <span class="text-sm font-bold font-serif italic" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:g2brbe">i</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-foreground m-0" data-ps="src/components/home/LandlordCosts.astro:31">
        <strong class="text-secondary">Hinweis:</strong> Die konkrete Umlagefähigkeit hängt von Mietvertrag, Maßnahme, Kostenverteilung und gesetzlichen Formvorgaben ab.<br/>Keine individuelle Rechtsberatung.
      </p>
    </div>

  </Container>
</section>
